{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昔日以「味之天使」以及金剛前女友身分廣為人知的陳蕊蕊（Yuri）雖然已淡出幕前幕前多時，但她對身材及外貌的管理依然一刻都沒有鬆懈！現年41歲的她在2023年與經營火鍋生意的圈外男友Eric Chan於泰國舉行婚禮，正式升呢做人妻。她近年主攻網上平台，並忙經營餐廳及酒吧生意，又不時在社交平台分享周遊列國、享受美食的寫意生活，近年更頻繁出入馬場，晉身上流社會。</p><figure><img alt=\"Keep得極好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166764150576254976724308.png/X2MvesqW8CLF314rdulDPea3WEsATpUAdygn5HcoJ-Q\"/><figcaption>Keep得極好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得極好！（IG截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260819/1166764147661082624051293.png/wy9tnvCuUFg1JQa4zbfhalR2jKf3kOe5NopUrTaKVK0\"/><figcaption>Keep得極好！（IG截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貴婦。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053346100985204736483196.jpeg/gqYaR34ltzukGhJJssQbesDasiDEVK3gCeJTuQniU7k\"/><figcaption>貴婦。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"視覺一流。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053346098669817856729645.jpeg/r8E6vvkP5BCyt3Fpu_UCwhtC39JcjrjscjQEuHI0BLg\"/><figcaption>視覺一流。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"馬會廂房。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053346095930806272382470.jpeg/oq6JJJ7Dj_eLIWioYjtbP0eTp1kL5sg2ehWw13oVsNc\"/><figcaption>馬會廂房。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳蕊蕊生活富貴！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250822/1035608363049684992316897.jpeg/qCG-6dHGVUvGK3t9PmaBKzSg7qOvtFJrAjmCAQI5ggE\"/><figcaption>陳蕊蕊生活富貴！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳蕊蕊正式成為人妻。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231201/807316998072569856916253.jpeg/slnPxTSm3agFkocSFwWOSpNtcFULuqJduSYvnLkmL5w\"/><figcaption>陳蕊蕊正式成為人妻。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"鄧伊婷親身祝賀陳蕊蕊出嫁。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231201/807318050381500416371546.jpeg/w8M1DvMalR6H0kKG4RILLg7aynHNgCkjAXdy_QF3cv0\"/><figcaption>鄧伊婷親身祝賀陳蕊蕊出嫁。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳蕊蕊與老公外型合襯。（IG圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20231201/807319443725094912658170.jpeg/r-LKVgwJL_4fESGU0C_AFU0BOAlN59ivdVgDAnVYAwI\"/><figcaption>陳蕊蕊與老公外型合襯。（IG圖片）</figcaption></figure><p>深V高衩辣爆攝影棚　極品身材凍齡有術</p><p>陳蕊蕊日前在社交平台Instagram限時動態晒出一組於攝影棚拍攝的工作側拍照。相中可見，她身穿一襲超深V黑色掛頸連身裙，大方展現驕人上圍與深邃事業線，下身配以高衩剪裁，大秀一雙修長美腿。無論是身材曲線、肌膚狀態抑或狀態氣場都極之頂級，凍齡有術保養得宜，完完全全看不出歲月痕跡！</p><p>升格人妻轉戰商界　頻入馬場富貴晉身上流</p><p>翻查資料，陳蕊蕊近年身邊朋友非富則貴，經常與馬主圈中人來往，她更曾曬出探馬匹銳義和 銳高的照片，兩匹馬均是凌志輝名下，凌志輝是上司公司主席，主要於香港從事地基工程服務。</p><figure><img alt=\"兩匹馬均是凌志輝名下。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053346644235522048185032.jpeg/kBkL85W-qaj--i7CqMpWI22yoY2MSuwCprHWcqax1nI\"/><figcaption>兩匹馬均是凌志輝名下。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩匹馬均是凌志輝名下。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20251010/1053346641873997824607854.jpeg/mFnoace3kng3gNIJyzyQO-z-nYK_a4IIF1reShda3ko\"/><figcaption>兩匹馬均是凌志輝名下。（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"生活寫意！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250822/1035609408081891328152687.jpeg/mgHV84sT4zJAdZUitWqo0RxNJ80M2rSgRAyOokQMjqI\"/><figcaption>生活寫意！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貴婦！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250822/1035609405456125952765830.jpeg/hRqCBEXfxcbli5MYN6uoGh9cPvKn2MJ0AUOo2gFDqNo\"/><figcaption>貴婦！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"出入馬場！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250822/1035609402905858048810296.jpeg/JBj5GXLpUEmFZCJnKum1masE5ZAFUxEnpoa3rqaGt64\"/><figcaption>出入馬場！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"近年生活富泰！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250822/1035609399881633792905617.jpeg/rgkPU9QcGCOnsUmfRdDrtA2MUqaG6Zs4XFxe7lxcXu4\"/><figcaption>近年生活富泰！（IG/@yuiyuiyuri）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T02:18:34.206439+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":761,"images":15,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}